/Title (Administer a TrueNAS SCALE server providing network storage for personal files, media, and application data. Organized storage into multiple datasets with scoped permissions, configured SMB and NFS shares with host/network access restrictions, and set up UPS monitoring \(NUT\) with a properly configured monitor user after diagnosing an initial misconfiguration. Receives and stores the scheduled backups pushed from the Proxmox host over NFS, and runs a small set of self-hosted apps directly on the NAS.)
